      "blocks": {
        "topic_1": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Clumping",
            "lead": "Small particles in your serum are expected.",
            "text": "<p>Nothing in the bottle is there to hold the particles (the Bacillus spores) in place or make them invisible, so natural settling and clumping are part of how it looks.</p><p>Shaking lifts the particles and spreads them through the liquid. It does not dissolve them. You’ll still see particles in a range of sizes after shaking, which is how the formula is meant to look, and they melt into your skin as you pat them in.</p>"
          }
        },
        "topic_2": {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Scent",
            "lead": "",
            "text": "<p>There is no added fragrance. You may notice a light natural scent when you first open the bottle, which softens as you apply and fades quickly afterward.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "topic_1",
        "topic_2"
      ]
